SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                100000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  10000
PrintEvery                    10000

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e5

